an athlete or a rapper

00:02:51.221 --> 00:02:52.973
or an artist of some sort so,

00:02:52.973 --> 00:02:56.126
to me this is an incredible time.

00:02:56.126 --> 00:02:58.700
The internet has created
so much opportunity.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:01.598
The fact that so many
people rolling down there,

00:03:01.598 --> 00:03:03.531
coming from such humble beginnings,

00:03:03.531 --> 00:03:05.447
